= Using the device class =

The [../classes/html/classdevice.html device class] provides methods for creating device nodes and performing I/O on device files.

The device class inherits from the filedescriptor class and adds a static method for creating device nodes.  Creating device nodes requires root privileges on most systems.

The following example demonstrates creating a character device node, writing data to /dev/null, and reading random bytes from /dev/urandom.

